_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"PYJ7YSaMmHM_7C4WwOuFgA","review_id":"WN8GdUch0UN-h0i1T43mdA","date":"2021-12-13T19:12:03","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.935063362121582,"text_excerpt":"Great addition to the Frenchman/Marigny Triangle dining scene! Friendly service. Excellent cup of coffee. Great breakfast options. Very good cinnamon roll. Not the super gooey type, but perfect with coffee. Shrimp & grits are awesome. I'm not much of an egg guy, but the spoonbread Benedict is a must-try for those of you who are. Looking forward to trying something from the lunch or dinner menu next time! Super casual vibe, inside or on the sidewalk."},{"business_id":"PYJ7YSaMmHM_7C4WwOuFgA","review_id":"AFQI4r_9IiTWP1StHLtyDA","date":"2021-10-06T00:44:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9297220706939697,"text_excerpt":"A great place to hang out and grab a cup of Joe. The interior and exterior are both freshly redone and offers a historic and quaint interior. I had an almond milk latte which was good and husband had a tasty cold brew mocha coffee. What my review rating is really Gor was the homemade yogurt bowl. Unfortunately my phone died so I was not able to snap a photo but if you enjoy raspberry, strawberry and granola you should try. I will be back and will update with photo. The barista said the cinnamon rolls are baked in house and they looked amazing. So hopefully I will have a chance to update my review on the those as well."},{"business_id":"PYJ7YSaMmHM_7C4WwOuFgA","review_id":"HWsPcZyl3tHFHnOmqbNmbQ","date":"2021-10-20T11:43:06","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9122685790061951,"text_excerpt":"After walking quite a way on a warm afternoon, my family and I were looking for a light lunch and cool refreshing drinks. We found Frenchmen All Day and eagerly went inside for a reprieve from the sun. The menu is modest-they don't try to do more than they can do well, and I appreciate that. Service was a little more laid back than I would have preferred...we never got refills on our waters, and being as thirsty as we were, we pulled out our own water from our backpack to refill our glasses ourselves. The food was good-between us, we enjoyed a Cuban sandwich, the chicken salad sandwich and a traditional American breakfast. Everything was tasty."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"PYJ7YSaMmHM_7C4WwOuFgA","photo_id":"c4RQ4T7rCUgYj11wdTMPtA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/c4RQ4T7rCUgYj11wdTMPtA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9018691778182983},{"business_id":"PYJ7YSaMmHM_7C4WwOuFgA","photo_id":"r3uWRWeDFevxP_vune97qw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/r3uWRWeDFevxP_vune97qw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8490549325942993},{"business_id":"PYJ7YSaMmHM_7C4WwOuFgA","photo_id":"0WDOr1MtKjvERFrHVVHndQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/0WDOr1MtKjvERFrHVVHndQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8141179084777832},{"business_id":"PYJ7YSaMmHM_7C4WwOuFgA","photo_id":"56xko65soAjEk-SroVBg-w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/56xko65soAjEk-SroVBg-w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7963855862617493},{"business_id":"PYJ7YSaMmHM_7C4WwOuFgA","photo_id":"nWc33yNL2R8nPwWNy34vsg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/nWc33yNL2R8nPwWNy34vsg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.788815